        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DROADO.owl#Tegmentum_mesencephali"/>
        <DROADO:Definition>A pinkish-yellow portion of the midbrain situated in the rostral mesencephalic tegmentum. It receives a large projection from the contralateral half of the CEREBELLUM via the superior cerebellar peduncle and a projection from the ipsilateral MOTOR CORTEX.</DROADO:Definition>
